       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-BALL-ROLLING.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BALL-ROLLING-PROOFS.
           05  WS-STATIC-TO-KINETIC-MOMENT PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NO-SLIP-HOLONOMIC-ROLL   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TORQUE-DYNAMO-INERTIA    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LYAPUNOV-LIMIT-CYCLE-CON PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BALL-ROLLING-SEAL        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-ROLLING-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-ROLLING-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-ROLLING-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-STATIC-AND-HOLONOMIC.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TORQUE-AND-LYAPUNOV.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-ROLLING-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-STATIC-AND-HOLONOMIC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STATIC-TO-KINETIC-MOMENT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-SLIP-HOLONOMIC-ROLL.
       2000-EVALUATE-TORQUE-AND-LYAPUNOV.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TORQUE-DYNAMO-INERTIA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LYAPUNOV-LIMIT-CYCLE-CON.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-ROLLING-PROOFS.
           IF WS-STATIC-TO-KINETIC-MOMENT = 1 AND
              WS-NO-SLIP-HOLONOMIC-ROLL = 1 AND
              WS-TORQUE-DYNAMO-INERTIA = 1 AND
              WS-LYAPUNOV-LIMIT-CYCLE-CON = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-BALL-ROLLING-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-ROLLING-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-ROLLING-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-ROLLING-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-ROLLING-CODE.
